Suggests: svent-artwork, network-manager, network-manager-gnome
Description: Svent OS bspwm desktop session and defaults
 Provides an X11 session with bspwm, sxhkd, Polybar, Rofi, Kitty and Dunst.
 Defaults are initialized on login and updated only while unmodified.
 Uses the Svent core catalog for category-based tool launching.
